{"chapter": "desirables", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "02BA", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{sites-section-introduction}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{sites-modules-section-introduction}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{sites-cohomology-section-introduction}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\noindent\n", "suffix": "\n\n"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:a00d8ddd24321d36b49317416e0e89e9bbfbb59a08023a8bd194a57d025ce793", "source_text": "We have a chapter on sites and sheaves, see Sites, Section <REF_0001>. We have a chapter on ringed sites (and topoi) and modules on them, see Modules on Sites, Section <REF_0002>. We have a chapter on cohomology in this setting, see Cohomology on Sites, Section <REF_0003>. But a lot more could be added, especially in the chapter on cohomology.", "source_text_hash": "sha256:fbeacc5908931487985213417d84a1359c35137566b2dade094e4482fb4f57ba", "unit_id": "tag:02BA:p001"}
